feat(tickets): registration, atomic capacity enforcement, QR ticket generation, and check-in attendance

- Implement atomic registration transaction with capacity check & duplicate registration prevention
- Implement QR code data URI generation using qrcode library with error correction
- Implement unpredictable cryptographic ticket codes (format: TKT-XXXXXXXX-YYYY)
- Implement user registration history (GET /api/registrations/my-registrations) and registration cancellation
- Implement organizer attendee management (GET /api/registrations/event/:id/attendees)
- Implement ticket retrieval and scanner preview verification (GET /api/tickets/:ticketCode, /verify/:ticketCode)
- Implement QR scanner check-in endpoint with duplicate check-in rejection (409 Conflict)
- Implement organizer event attendance summary with turnout metrics (GET /api/attendance/event/:id)
- Verified with 10 automated end-to-end smoke tests (all passing)
